  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006, 0.652970 accuracy) outperform other RNA-only and multimodal configurations. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt while retaining transformer aggregation (a key factor in previous success) could further improve performance. It isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, which remains uncertain despite scvi_n200's strong performance. This balances exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of a new encoder, maximizing the chance of finding a better configuration within the remaining budget."
}

